# Core System

Simple backend service built with Go and PostgreSQL.

## 📋 Requirements

Go

PostgreSQL

## 🚀 Run Application
```
go run main.go
```

## 🌱 Run Seeder
```
go run ./migration/main.go
```
Default Password admin123

## 📂 Project Structure (Simplified)

```
main.go                 → Entry point aplikasi
migration/main.go       → Entry point seeder
migration/*.sql         → File SQL migration
```